## .ini 解析映射

| .ini 字段 | API 字段 | 说明 |
|-----------|----------|------|
| DinoClass | `species_blueprint` | 路径末段 |
| DinoNameTag | `name` | 可选 |
| Stats[0]~[6] | `wild_levels.{stat}` | 属性值 |
| RandomMutationsFemale | `mutations_maternal` | |
| RandomMutationsMale | `mutations_paternal` | |
| TamedEffectiveness | `tame_effectiveness` | |

Stat 索引：0=health, 1=stamina, 2=oxygen, 3=food, 4=weight, 5=melee_damage_multiplier, 6=speed_multiplier

